h_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_battleball_pitcher_myth_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["去吃烤肉？你没看到我正控制饮食吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["あなたが私の球を打つって？夢でも見てるの？","お肉の話はやめて、私、今、食事制限中なのだから"]},"keys":["Voice_battleball_pitcher_myth_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_battleball_pitcher_myth_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["又是转会邀请？说了我不考虑跳槽。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["また移籍のオファーメールかな？移籍する気はないって言ってるのに"]},"keys":["Voice_battleball_pitcher_myth_1_NoticeMail"]}]}]}
